  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Programa de Becas Escolares de Emergencia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Tuition Waiver Program Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de esta cooperacin tcnica es utilizar fondos de la Fundacin Educacin Sobre Todo (Education Above All) para contribuir al HA-L1102 y otorgar becas escolares a nios no escolarizados y escolarizados en los departamentos afectados por el terremoto de magnitud 7.2 del 14 de agosto de 2021.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this Technical Cooperation is to use Education Above All Foundation (EAA) financing to contribute to the HA-L1102 and provide tuition waivers to out of school children (OOSC) and enrolled children in the areas affected by the August 14, 2021 7,2 magintude earthquake</narrative>
  </description>
